{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方最大号的白色标题“回去未必找回亲近，他仍想：万一能呢？”，随后容易被中部紫色放大的“不愿只凭指望回去忍让”吸引。下方白色大句也很显眼。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他仍在考虑回去，但不确定能否重新找回亲近，处于想回去又有所顾虑的状态。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"犹豫、不确定、仍抱有希望。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他具体害怕独自承担事情、缺乏底气；目前打算先把生活稳定下来，但并没有放弃原来的打算。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"标题、紫色强调句、下方白色大句都是显眼的大块文字，存在一定的主视线竞争。\",\n    \"下方灰色小字连续排列，需要额外扫读才能获取舞步变化、祈祷转为意志等辅助信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9a60197-2927-4b81-9310-cf7a703ac174", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T024112488599Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:41:37.795603+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1de29f61697c205cb70499871ae2f4834ff18186b3119d97ba6cff21b10ad445", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen